Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416.923,296.313)}Interview with main voice actor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\pos(294.691,428.369)}The Voice of Shana:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.98,TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(490.634,432.391)}Kugimiya Rie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:09.90,Text,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur13.408\i1\pos(362.253,288.268)}Tell us your opinion after reading the original Manga...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been terribly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an ordinary "fantasy" story, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:01:29.22,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(152.968,96.514)}Question:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:01:29.22,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(276.971,126.693)}About your image of Shana...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:02:03.71,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(151.316,98.514)}Question:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:02:03.71,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(243.943,124.693)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:03:03.40,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(156.881,93)}Question:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:03:03.40,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(276.971,122.693)}About Your View of Shana....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:04:20.82,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\)\pos(150.275,91)}Question:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:04:20.82,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(282.079,119.374)}How did you interpret Shana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:05:41.15,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(152.968,92.514)}Question:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:05:41.15,TS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(289.89,123.374)}Your message for the viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't read it... not reading it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't make a difference, or so I thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, when I started working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking-it all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"I wondered about the feeling that before I know it"...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"The people I hold dear to my heart... like family...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends and such... suddenly all vanish out of existence..."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there was a lof of specific terms 1 didn't remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, knowing them I could convey great fear or sorrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just reading-it, l forgot completely that the situations in there were made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And all these growing characters...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There were conflicts, there were drawbacks,...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There were fights, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with all that, as I thought, absolutely,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowhere a single line...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Felt like a somewhat "thin" shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have felt so, but, we may say...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,An everlasting... how to say... shadow", maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it has both the light and dark themes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The story made progress very slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:34.24,Text,,0,0,0,,{\blur18.771\i1\pos(360,285.587)}Your impression when you first saw the preview.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you all saw it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.50,0:01:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier I was shown the preview...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The preview was somehow really short, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like a movie and the soundtrack too was badass...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And even the animation was so great, l thought "it's somewhat REALLY good!", it really got into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The part they showed us was short, but extremely... The production world's view was so fixed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That we told ourselves that’it.was really going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,1 thought that, with this pace, the anime will do wonders...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's giving me great hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:18.79,Text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,223.911)}About Shana's image?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When I read the original story...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I thought she was extremely formidable, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She dealt with her so called "deep fears" fast, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All her fights till then, they were the proof of her very own existence...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighfing... was shaping the look on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She interacted with the humans in various ways...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you dig deep in to her soul, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she was like saying "what's going to happen from now on?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:03:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a lively girl who is looking forward to whatever the future may bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:08.38,Text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(357.747,250.726)}How did you interpret Shana?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When I held Shana's dialogue book in my hands....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When I did it for the very first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound technician told me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, do the voice acting as you're doing now, but lower the voice tone with a slightly lowered pitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When I changed my voice to match their suggestions...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I said: "No way! Shana can't sound like a kodomo", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we then went for that Minmin-like voice of Shana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The mood in the anime fits the situation better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It surpassed it, more than fit in that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stuff like Shana-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s various emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stuff like Shana-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s various emotions...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep fears...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I expressed them with my heart in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,About my rival...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshida Kazumi-{\i1}chan{\i0} said...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When I've been reading the story, l kept saying to myself, "Kazumi-{\i1}chan{\i0} would be bad at this".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a lively woman who has lot of points concerning Shana and Yuuj's reality, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems so casual...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shana is a like... she is so clever...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Combined with her ability to handle anything that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:25.47,Text,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,000)\pos(372.375,289.609)}Your message for the viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The origindLstory is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Extremely interesting, and'extremely complex, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who ore fans of such complicated mysteries...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there are many fans who get fascinated by a story such as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When I read this too, I loved it and it made me hold my breath...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also for the fans of the light novel... hope I entertain them with my voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I too once read it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if the fans enjoy my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,| won't betray anyone's expectations, or else it would be like betraying the meaning in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,1 think I have understood the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, the original story.has been interesting, and so,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to dp all of it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the story is still progressing, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The light novel is the original work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Anime can enjoy the same success.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We must live up to everyone's expectations, and if we able to, I'll be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I voice Shana-{\i1}chan{\i0} very passionately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please cheer and support the author and the anime producers and the studio. Thank you.
